OL,3,AHealey due to unveil tax and spending
OL,4,Aplans in Burnham's first Budget
OL,5,
OL,6,FChancellor John Healey will set out the
OL,7,Fgovernment's tax and spending plans
OL,8,Fwhen he unveils the Budget at 12:30 GMT
OL,9,F- here's how the day will unfold
OL,11,FThe government has promised a plan that
OL,12,F"moves money and power out of
OL,13,FWestminster", but ministers face
OL,14,Fpressure on the cost of living and
OL,15,Ffunding defence
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
