OL,3,AHealey due to unveil tax and spending
OL,4,Aplans in Burnham's first Budget
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis first Budget of Andy Burnham's
OL,7,Fpremiership is due to shield some
OL,8,Fpensioners from income tax and increase
OL,9,Fthe minimum wage - though the BBC
OL,10,Funderstands 18- to 20-year-olds are set
OL,11,Fto see lower increases than in previous
OL,12,Fyears
OL,14,FIt comes as inflation hit 3.5% in the
OL,15,F12 months to September, largely driven
OL,16,Fby soaring fuel prices amid the war in
OL,17,FIran
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
